  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stemming the Tide of Abuse in Nigeria&#x2019;s Digital Space (STANDS): Influencing digital law and policy towards positive change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to stem the tide of abuse in Nigeria&#x2019;s digital space by influencing digital law and policy towards positive change.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has a diverse range of target audiences. Government prosecutors, judges, legislators for training. It also targets the average citizen through media ads and campaigns. It further targets relevant government institutions and other stakeholders in civil society and the technical community through our research and participation and organization of global convenings</narrative>
  </description>
