   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Rights Workshop for Prosecutors and Law Enforcement</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trained them to strengthen their capacity to address, prosecute, and investigate internet-related matters. The objectives of the workshop were to sensitize participants on their particular role in safeguarding and promoting human rights online in their daily work,  reinforce an ethos of legality and compliance with international human rights standards within law enforcement agencies, as well as provide a platform for discussion and information sharing on Internet governance standards relevant to the work of prosecutors, and finally, provide a platform for discussion and information sharing on digital rights standards relevant to the work of law enforcement.</narrative>
   </description>
